<Text>&lt;font color="#000000" size=11&gt;

&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;List&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; controls can take many shapes.
The skinned &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; shows its flexibilty here by demonstrating several types of list, even though they are all the same class of control.
Here are examples of vertical &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lists&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; with and without &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scroll Bars&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;:

